+"""Tests for Exp6312 model-local representation surface preflight.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-INFRA-6312, SCENARIO-INFRA-6312-COMPLETE-NULL,
+SCENARIO-INFRA-6312-SURFACE-SELECTION, SCENARIO-INFRA-6312-CONTROLS.
+"""
